sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as User and S11
  participant P1 as S10 governance
  participant P2 as Owner APIs
  participant P3 as Executor
  participant P4 as Provider
  participant P5 as S12 validation
  alt Required current prerequisites hold
    P0->>P1: 1 Request exact plan and context
    P1->>P2: 2 Read current source and access receipts
    P2->>P1: 3 Return bounded current owner facts
    P1->>P0: 4 Reserve one bound attempt
    P0->>P3: 5 Deliver plan and reservation
    P3->>P1: 6 Current permit and fence check
    P3->>P4: 7 Check provider preconditions
    P3->>P3: 8 Persist DISPATCHING attempt
    P3->>P4: 9 Dispatch conditional request
    P4->>P3: 10 Return observed effect or uncertainty
    P3->>P0: 11 Retain outcome and request identity
    P0->>P5: 12 Request independent mandatory probes
    P5->>P0: 13 Return observed validation evidence
    P0->>P1: 14 Retain final justified disposition
  else A prerequisite fails or an external outcome is uncertain
    Note over P0,P5: Denied, stale or unavailable current authority stops new dispatch. A lost provider response stays Unknown until reconciliation.
  end
